# Next.js / React

- Routes live under `src/app/`. Server Components by default. `'use client'` only for interactive islands.
- Use `next/image` and `next/link`. Colocate styles in `*.module.scss`. Import via `@/*`.
- New code: no `any`. Reuse existing lib types. Do not flip `tsconfig.json` `strict: false` unless asked.

# Token budget

- Output the diff only. Do not restate the request, write tutorials, or dump full files.
- Do not format in-chat. The `afterFileEdit` hook owns formatting.
- Delegate verbose logs to `debugger`. Delegate pass/fail checks to `verifier`.
